  {
   "id": "pO4VdmCpFSsJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
   "author": "d42e88b7645d03c8",
   "date": "2013-10-23T07:12:42Z",
   "subject": "Re: 如何預測未來值",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi friend,</div><div> </div><div>依問題的性質而言, 可以考慮採用 時間序列的方法, 其中 forecast 套件也是不錯的選擇, 其功能包括 ARIMA model, 參考以下之範例:</div><div> </div><div><font face=\"courier new,monospace\" size=\"2\"># title: ARIMA model<br># date: 2013.10.23<br>library(forecast)<br>fit &lt;- auto.arima(WWWusage) # size=100, ARIMA(1,1,1)<br>fit<br>fit.forecast &lt;- forecast(fit, h=10) # forecast for 10 periods<br>fit.forecast # confidence interval for 80% and 95%<br>plot(fit.forecast, main=&quot;Forecast for 10 periods&quot;, <br>     xlab=&quot;Time&quot;, ylab=&quot;WWW Used&quot;,xlim=c(0,120))<br># end</font></div><div> </div><div># 以下圖形顯示未來10期的預測值.</div><div style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em\" href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q5b7En61Qm4/Umd0o2HsQXI/AAAAAAAAAn4/4FyF7d7qx6U/s1600/arima-forecast.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q5b7En61Qm4/Umd0o2HsQXI/AAAAAAAAAn4/4FyF7d7qx6U/s1600/arima-forecast.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238750933000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1OaKT4YoZNJXPvHoawQ4cO\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"136\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q5b7En61Qm4/Umd0o2HsQXI/AAAAAAAAAn4/4FyF7d7qx6U/s320/arima-forecast.png\" border=\"0\"></a></div><div align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"> </div><div># 以下圖形繪製包括10期的預測值:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em\" href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-YRkq3zS8xHQ/Umd1BhgCDyI/AAAAAAAAAoA/gEuTLid_igo/s1600/arima-plot.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-YRkq3zS8xHQ/Umd1BhgCDyI/AAAAAAAAAoA/gEuTLid_igo/s1600/arima-plot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238750933000&amp;usg=AOvVaw04sJhYfYQLmlWvOb0Zp10C\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"253\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-YRkq3zS8xHQ/Umd1BhgCDyI/AAAAAAAAAoA/gEuTLid_igo/s320/arima-plot.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div># 注意: 如同 Wush 提及, 所有方法皆有其理論基礎, 鼓勵多參考其他資料.</div><div><br>manman於 2013年10月22日星期二UTC+8下午10時27分25秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
